\section{Mutability}{

The \code{set_}, \code{append_}, and \code{add_} functions DO NOT modify the
\code{netsim_dat} object in place. The result must be assigned back to
\code{dat} in order to be registered: \verb{dat <- set_*(dat, item, value)}.
